cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CGAP LENS, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "CGAP LENS"
abstract: >-
  CGAP LENS is an interactive catalog of regulatory indicators for financial
  sector authorities. It helps users explore, filter, and build custom sets of
  indicators relevant to sociodemographically disaggregated analysis in
  financial regulation, with a particular focus on gender. Indicators are
  organized by supervisory mandate and objective, and are designed to be
  customized by applying breakdowns such as gender, age, location, provider
  type, and product type. LENS is part of CGAP's Supply-side Gender
  Disaggregated Data (S-GDD) project and is a companion resource to CGAP's
  Technical Guide for Financial Sector Authorities.
type: software
authors:
